@PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Hämta alla produkter
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Hämta produkt via slug
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?slug=mud-mugg
Accept: application/json

### Hämta produkt via id
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Skapa produkt
POST {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Mugg",
  "description": "En testprodukt",
  "price": 99,
  "image": "/products/test-mug.png"
}

### Radera produkt
DELETE {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/29